silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_06_bind_law_alternates_concrete_anchor#bindapplication_vetrecord_typestep silm:hasLongDescription "The BindApplication_VetRecord_TypeStep is BindApplication_VetRecord_TypeStep: the bind application VetRecord_77_tree >>= TypeStep_fn; substitutes VetRecord_77 (the leaf of VetRecord_77_tree) with the output of TypeStep_fn(VetRecord_77) = T_Sigma(TypedRecord_77); the resulting tree adds a type-step layer to the existing tree structure." .
