silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_06_bind_law_alternates_concrete_anchor#kleislipipeline_ingesttypevalidaterender silm:hasLongDescription "The KleisliPipeline_IngestTypeValidateRender is KleisliPipeline_IngestTypeValidateRender: the Kleisli composition ingest_fn >=> type_fn >=> validate_fn >=> render_fn; maps TartuClinicIntakeForm through the four publish stages to VetCarePlanPDF_77; the four-gate publish pipeline expressed as Kleisli composition." .
