silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_06_bind_law_alternates_concrete_anchor#kleislicategory_t_sigma silm:hasLongDescription "The KleisliCategory_T_Sigma is KleisliCategory_T_Sigma: the Kleisli category of the free monad T_Sigma; objects = sets (types); morphisms = Kleisli arrows f: X -> T_Sigma(Y); composition = Kleisli composition >=>; identity = eta (the monad unit); the publish pipeline is a morphism in this category." .
